Third-party data credits
=========================

QuestPrereqs.lua is generated from the quest_template table of the CMaNGOS
classic-db world database (https://github.com/cmangos/classic-db), by the CMaNGOS
project, licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0
(https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html).

The talent builds in TalentBuilds/ are converted from the WoW Classic leveling
guides of Wowhead (https://www.wowhead.com); each build names the guide it comes
from in its `source` field.

QuestNames.lua and ZoneIDs.lua are generated from the quest and zone databases
of pfQuest (https://github.com/shagu/pfQuest) by Eric Mauser (Shagu), used here
under its MIT license:

